{"toolCallId":"call_dc5b0fc524e642c896edb157082b758f","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"  echo \"Use --help for usage information\" >&2\n  exit 1\nfi\n\n# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# 6. CALCULATE SCORES\n# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSCORE_LOC=$(calculate_loc_score \"$LOC\")\nSCORE_FILES=$(calculate_files_score \"$FILES\")\nSCORE_RISK=$(calculate_risk_score)\nSCORE_COMPLEXITY=$(calculate_complexity_score)\n\nTOTAL_SCORE=$((SCORE_LOC + SCORE_FILES + SCORE_RISK + SCORE_COMPLEXITY))\n\n# Determine recommended level\ndetermine_level \"$TOTAL_SCORE\"\n\n# Calculate confidence\ncalculate_confidence\n\n# Calculate phase recommendation (default on; opt-out via --no-recommend-phases)\nif [[ \"$RECOMMEND_PHASES\" = true ]]; then\n  determine_phasing\nfi\n\n# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# 7. OUTPUT RESULTS\n# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nif [[ \"$JSON_OUTPUT\" = true ]]; then\n  output_json\nelse\n  output_text\nfi\n\nexit 0\n\n# Exit codes:\n#   0 - Success\n#   1 - ERROR: --loc requires a numeric value\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"8e51fe","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
